setTreasury.t.sol
├── when the caller is not the owner
│   └── it should revert with the {OwnableUnauthorizedAccount} error
└── when the caller is the owner
    ├── when the new treasury is the zero address
    │   └── it should revert with the {InvalidZeroAddressTreasury} error
    └── when the new treasury is not the zero address
        ├── it should update the treasury address
        └── it should emit the {TreasuryUpdated} event
